🚨 CRITICAL RED FLAGS - STOP IMMEDIATELY IF YOU SEE THESE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

□ Day 1 and writing code → Do discovery first
□ Week 2 and sponsor hasn't seen work → Schedule check-in today
□ Same metric calculated multiple ways → Get clear definition
□ Numbers don't match published reports → Investigate before proceeding
□ Building something complex, not sure why → Review project charter
□ Stakeholder surprised by deliverable → Show work-in-progress earlier

