✅ PROJECT SUCCESS METRICS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

EFFICIENCY:
□ Delivered within estimated timeline (±20%)
□ Less than 10 hours of rework
□ First draft within 20% of final

PROCESS:
□ Project charter signed off by Day 3
□ Weekly check-ins starting Week 1
□ Data validated before analysis

QUALITY:
□ Zero calculation errors
□ Stakeholder: "This is exactly what I needed"
□ Code is documented and reusable

OUTCOME:
□ Analysis drives an actual decision
□ Deliverable gets used (not shelved)
□ Stakeholder requests follow-up work

